Built in (the 3DS): the health cap only while switched on

The mod replaces func_global_asm_806C9974 to cap the pending health change
at 12 (many Golden Bananas spawning at once overflowed it). Built into the
patches it is the function for good, so the cap follows the setting and
the function is the game's own while the mod is off.

